    "extension_mode": "before_roll",
    "note": "Count from the day after the trigger; include the last day. A last day on a Saturday, Sunday or court holiday rolls to the next court day (§12a). A service extension is added to the unextended last day, then §12a applies to the result. Counting backward from a hearing, the day of the hearing is excluded (§12c) and a result on a non-court day moves to the court day before."
